{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mechgouki/luoyang-city/pulls/87","id":5469109612,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVpoYrs8AAAABRfv9bA","html_url":"https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/pull/87","diff_url":"https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/pull/87.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/pull/87.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mechgouki/luoyang-city/issues/87","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mechgouki/luoyang-city/pulls/87/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mechgouki/luoyang-city/pulls/87/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mechgouki/luoyang-city/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mechgouki/luoyang-city/issues/87/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mechgouki/luoyang-city/statuses/c3b9dc8a0da9cda023a26a10aa63d06bd9c8d2f7","number":87,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"永宁寺三图专题：基址叠加、局部修正与回嵌预览","user":{"login":"mechgouki","id":8364215,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNjQyMTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8364215?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechgouki","html_url":"https://github.com/mechgouki","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechgouki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechgouki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechgouki/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechgouki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechgouki/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechgouki/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechgouki/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechgouki/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechgouki/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## 为什么需要这次更新\n\n用户已明确要求「永宁寺基址叠加对照图＋修正局部图＋全景回嵌预览」三项可见成果。此前的试片与控制底稿没有把同尺度实见边、剩余偏差和实际回嵌结果放到一个可查看、可下载的页面中。\n\n## 本次交付\n\n- 新增 `luoyang-yongning-study.html`，由现有 V14 审查页进入；叠加对照通栏、局部居中、全景保留原幅，手机纵向阅读。\n- 提供三张原 PNG、叠加 SVG、来源／几何／审查 JSON 和发布清单，共 8 项独立下载。\n- 保存实际生成输入、五次局部／回嵌尝试及其提示、固定显示变换和独立图像审查。\n- 构建与线上验收都实际点击每一项下载并保留字节，增加精简专题 evidence artifact；原有测试和全量 evidence 上传继续保留。\n\n原件：[基址叠加](https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/c3b9dc8a0da9cda023a26a10aa63d06bd9c8d2f7/research/panorama-r12/yongning-triptych-20261124/overlay.png) · [修正局部](https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/c3b9dc8a0da9cda023a26a10aa63d06bd9c8d2f7/research/panorama-r12/yongning-triptych-20261124/corrected-local.png) · [回嵌预览](https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/c3b9dc8a0da9cda023a26a10aa63d06bd9c8d2f7/research/panorama-r12/yongning-triptych-20261124/reintegration-preview.png) · [完整审查](https://github.com/mechgouki/luoyang-city/blob/c3b9dc8a0da9cda023a26a10aa63d06bd9c8d2f7/research/panorama-r12/yongning-triptych-20261124/review.json)\n\n## 实际研究结论\n\n局部图保留九层塔、三层南门和塔后佛殿。塔座前缘三个样本改善至约 −0.7～+1.2 px；侧缘和角点仍有残差，南门前缘仍低约 11～13 px，完整基址未通过。\n\n回嵌第三版清除了低位重复门，但小门只一层门身清楚可辨、基脚约低 7 个全景像素，塔／后殿下部仍难分离。编辑区外约 99.992% 像素被重绘，不能声称仅局部改变。上述失败项随图公开，完整全景与首页换图批准均为 false。\n\n冻结 H 不变，不为单体重新拟合；不增加古代实测坐标。既有六次 V14 拒用记录、第五次主显示、第六次附录、原 27 项下载及 V12 首页保持。\n\n## 已完成的本地验证\n\n- 原 V14 10 项测试、新专题 3 项测试通过。\n- R11、V14、新专题实际资源与语义核验通过。\n- 桌面／手机的新页均通过 3 张原图、锚点刷新和全部 8 项真实下载；旧 V14 每端 27 项真实下载通过。\n- 已实际查看最终通栏对照、局部及手机全景截图；最终三图 SHA 与 source／geometry／review、清单相互绑定。\n- 工作树构造的完整 tree 与上传 Git tree 一致：`92fa3faf994ed1172512697b18024a5c9948d54b`。\n\nPR 仍需完整 CI；合并后按既有 build → deploy → verify-live 流程验收并保存本轮原始证据。研究限制不因网站发布而解除。\n\n关联 #52、#47；本次不关闭完整全景研究任务。","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-24T08:59:40Z","updated_at":"2026-11-24T09:14:33Z","closed_at":"2026-11-24T09:14:33Z","merged_at":"2026-11-24T09:14:33Z","merge_commit_sha":"bbfbac9022e133e61836614f3b120cf42efde43e","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"mechgouki:feat/yongning-tript